OL,3,GNEWSABeer dating back to 1890 revived
OL,4,Aafter journal find
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Sussex brewery has recreated an
OL,7,F136-year-old beer from a long-lost
OL,8,Frecipe after it was re-discovered in an
OL,9,Farchive.
OL,11,FHarvey's Brewery in Lewes has brewed
OL,12,Fits latest ale after a recipe dating
OL,13,Fback to 1890 was recreated from the
OL,14,Fjournal of the son of one of it's head
OL,15,Fbrewers.
OL,17,FThe brewery now says that it also
OL,18,Faiming to recreate more lost recipes
OL,19,Ffrom the journal, which was originally
OL,20,Funearthed in 2019.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
