OL,3,GNEWSABeer dating back to 1890 revived
OL,4,Aafter journal find
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeter Yarlett, the current head brewer
OL,7,Fat Harvey's said: "It's not every day
OL,8,Fyou get the chance to brew a beer from
OL,9,Fa recipe that's been lost for over a
OL,10,Fcentury, particularly in the very
OL,11,Fbrewery where it was first created."
